<entry>
    <title><![CDATA[Multiline tables]]></title>
    <link href="https://example.com/tables/multiline" />
    <id>https://example.com/tables/multiline</id>
    <published>2024-03-04T00:00:00Z</published>
    <updated>2024-03-04T00:00:00Z</updated>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>A multiline table needs a full separator line at the top:</p>
<table style="width:27%;">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 13%" />
<col style="width: 13%" />
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style="text-align: left;">Left</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">Right</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">alpha
gamma</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">beta
delta</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2 id="a-too-wide-table">A too-wide table</h2>
<p>A table with a very long, unbroken cell overflows its column. The example stylesheet wraps it in a scrollable <code>.wide</code> container.</p>
<div class="wide">
<table>
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 50%" />
<col style="width: 50%" />
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Key</th>
<th>Value</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>short</td>
<td>short</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>a-long-unbroken-token</td>
<td>this-cell-contains-an-extremely-long-unbroken-string-that-forces-the-table-wider-than-the-page-aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>]]></content>
</entry>
<entry>
    <title><![CDATA[Grid tables]]></title>
    <link href="https://example.com/tables/grid" />
    <id>https://example.com/tables/grid</id>
    <published>2024-03-03T00:00:00Z</published>
    <updated>2024-03-03T00:00:00Z</updated>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>A grid table draws cell borders with <code>+</code> and <code>-</code>.</p>
<table style="width:36%;">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 17%" />
<col style="width: 18%" />
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Term</th>
<th>Meaning</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Grid table</td>
<td>Cells are
drawn with +</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>A grid table can carry a footer, marked by an extra <code>=</code> separator:</p>
<table style="width:22%;">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 12%" />
<col style="width: 10%" />
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Item</th>
<th>Price</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Eggs</td>
<td>5</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Milk</td>
<td>3</td>
</tr>
</tbody><tfoot>
<tr>
<td>Total</td>
<td>8</td>
</tr>
</tfoot>

</table>]]></content>
</entry>
<entry>
    <title><![CDATA[Simple tables]]></title>
    <link href="https://example.com/tables/simple" />
    <id>https://example.com/tables/simple</id>
    <published>2024-03-02T00:00:00Z</published>
    <updated>2024-03-02T00:00:00Z</updated>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>A simple table uses a single <code>-</code> row under the header:</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style="text-align: left;">Option</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">data</td>
<td>path to data files.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">engine</td>
<td>template engine used.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>]]></content>
</entry>
<entry>
    <title><![CDATA[Pipe tables]]></title>
    <link href="https://example.com/tables/pipe" />
    <id>https://example.com/tables/pipe</id>
    <published>2024-03-01T00:00:00Z</published>
    <updated>2024-03-01T00:00:00Z</updated>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Pipe tables are the most common table syntax.</p>
<h2 id="alignment">Alignment</h2>
<p>Alignment is expressed with colons on the separator row:</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th style="text-align: left;">Left</th>
<th style="text-align: center;">Center</th>
<th style="text-align: right;">Right</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">alpha</td>
<td style="text-align: center;">beta</td>
<td style="text-align: right;">gamma</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">one</td>
<td style="text-align: center;">two</td>
<td style="text-align: right;">three</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2 id="captions">Captions</h2>
<p>A table can carry a caption:</p>
<table>
<caption>A captioned pipe table.</caption>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Name</th>
<th>Value</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>alpha</td>
<td>1</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>beta</td>
<td>2</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>]]></content>
</entry>

